{"id":"fons","title":"Fons","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":55,"backlinks":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Pots posar colors de fons o imatges. Amb les imatges de fons, és important controlar que no es repeteixin (<code>no-repeat</code>) i com s&#39;ajusten a l&#39;espai (<code>cover</code> fa que la imatge ompli tot el bloc sense deformar-se) .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.hero</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-image</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">url</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;fondo.jpg&quot;</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-size</span>: cover;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-position</span>: center;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-repeat</span>: no-repeat;\n}</code></pre></div>"}